# JavaScript Loops Assignment

I created this project for my JS loops task to perform math operationsm.

## What I Did for this task
- Created `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js` files in my project folder.
- Set up `num = 153` and `n = 10` variables to run calculations.
- Used a for loop to calculate sum of first n numbers and print multiplication table.
- Used a while loop to extract digits and find sum of digits and Armstrong number sum.
- Used a loop with modulus operator `%` to check if number is prime and list all factors.
- Printed all outputs to console using `console.log()` and displayed them on the browser screen.